  "body": "I have seen many issues touching on this topic but no conclusive answers here or in documentation. I manage a homeserver that has been operating standalone for many months now but it still peppers the logs trying to reach out the dozens of external homeservers.\r\n\r\nHow can I make this stop?\r\n\r\nI have already tried the following which were suggested in other reponses:\r\n\r\n1. removed the federation listener from homeserver.yml\r\n2. set the federation whitelist to \" \"\r\n3. purged all old rooms that were left over from federation\r\n4. manually cleared all rows in the \"destinations\" and \"destination_room\" database tables\r\n\r\n what exactly needs to be done to stop all federation activity and remove all record of previously federated servers?",
